2026-08-28:

The IDE/SATA converters JM20330 EVB-002-3 and MCA004 have been tested and work perfectly on Linux.
However, they cause problems on the CPU09IDE with a UniFLEX image. 
Further investigation is needed, they have been tested with only 1 type of HDD and 1 type of SSD.

All the other IDE/SATA converters work perfectly with UniFLEX, 
but due to their size, they do not fit very well on the Device Board.

See DISK_TYPES.


